# Git workflow (veeshtral-sdk)

- **Never commit or push directly to `main`.**
- Always: `git checkout -b feat|fix|chore/<name>` from up-to-date `main` → commit → `git push -u origin HEAD` → `gh pr create --base main` → merge after CI green.
- Do not use `git push origin main` for feature work.
- After merge, delete the feature branch.
- See `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the full policy.
- **Note:** On this private free-tier repo, GitHub branch protection/rulesets are unavailable — policy is convention + this rule only until the repo is public or the org upgrades. Do not treat docs as server-side enforcement.
